@title Formatting sample
# -> Harbour notice board <-
-> {grey:Hals harbour · updated daily} <-

>!red **Gale warning:** wind {red:18 m/s} from the west tonight.
>!green The fuel pier is open again.

## Tides

| Day | High | Low | Height |
|-----|:----:|:---:|-------:|
| Mon | 06:10 | 12:25 | 0.4 m |
| Tue | 06:52 | 13:07 | {blue:0.5 m} |
| Wed | ~~07:30~~ *07:35* | 13:50 | 0.6 m |

## Boats out

| Boat | Skipper | Status |
|---|---|---|
| Mågen | Anna | {green:in} |
| Tern | Bo | {!yellow:late} |
| Ida | Carl | {!red:no contact} |

---

Text can be **bold**, *italic*, ~~struck~~ or `code`, in
{red:red}, {orange:orange}, {yellow:yellow}, {green:green},
{blue:blue}, {purple:purple} and {grey:grey}, or on a
{!yellow:highlight}. Colours hold other markup: {blue:**bold blue**}.

> A plain quote
> keeps its lines.

>!blue Callouts come in every colour: `>!blue`, `>!grey`…

